cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: arithmetica
abstract: >-
  Exact geometric predicates for f64 input in Rust. A Rust implementation of
  Shewchuk's adaptive-precision orientation, in-circle and in-sphere tests,
  extended so that each returns the exact sign of its determinant for every
  finite f64 input, with exact line-intersection points and the expansion
  arithmetic underneath.

authors:
